	(text "Two bench VSOLAR injection channels (PM brief section 6.3, decision D2). No per-face current limiting: all six FC face VSOLAR pins (J1/J2/J6/J9/J11/J13) are one net, so two independent bench channels are sufficient to demonstrate diode-OR / one-face-shadowed behaviour."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6b861360-3741-4c3d-9666-d531f0d2873c")
	)
	(text "Bench PSU setting: 12 V to 18 V nominal, HARD MAXIMUM 24 V (brief section 6.3; F400/F401 are 33 V Vmax, so 9 V of margin). INA219 U8 (0x41) IN+"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 160 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "72e6bd44-1283-4803-92c8-ada75ecbe28f")
	)
	(text "absolute maximum on VSOLAR is 26 V (eps_side.kicad_sch); LT3652 IC6 operating maximum input is 32 V. Startup needs VIN >= VFLOAT + 3.3 V = 11.7 V for"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 162 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3082de8d-bacc-40d9-8cb6-1dab5108a2aa")
	)
	(text "the 8.38 V float set by R71/R74 on eps_side. This 11.7 V threshold is at VSOLAR, downstream of F400/F401 (R1max 0.150 ohm) and D400/D401 (~0.25-0.31 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 164 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fbd1d5e4-81b6-4d26-84f7-1e7099981e57")
	)
	(text "at <=1.2 A): the series drop is ~0.4-0.5 V at the expected bench current, so set the bench terminal to >=12.3 V (12.5 V recommended) to actually clear"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 166 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5a005a02-36cc-425e-acfc-8aa9ace885f9")
	)
	(text "11.7 V at VSOLAR -- a terminal reading of exactly 12.0 V will not reliably start the charger."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 168 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9cac1a73-6925-4fe7-bc18-57b69f02cc72")
	)
	(text "FC finding (not repeated on this sheet, per brief section 6.3): eps_side.kicad_sch text note \"VSOLAR 9V to 40V\" near IC6 is INCORRECT -- 40 V exceeds"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 176.89 0)
		(effects
