	(text "F400/F401: Littelfuse 2920L185DR PPTC resettable fuse (LCSC C207086, JLC Extended, SMD 2920/7451 metric): 1.85 A Ihold / 3.70 A Itrip / 33 V Vmax / 40"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
