		(uuid "c0926870-f16a-489b-897b-5326297dd1d3")
	)
	(text "rating and derates with temperature. The datasheet Temperature Rerating table gives 2920L185 hold current = 2.80 / 2.47 / 2.17 / 1.85 / 1.54 / 1.39 /"
